                    <!-- Coaching Featured Image Start -->
                    <div class="coaching-single-image">
                        <figure class="image-anime reveal">
                            <img src="~/img/Invest/360_F_1503291033_ZL0XBM3FOGu0b1poF9Ok6gcvfbqqJ2Vo-2757889068.jpg" alt="Invest in Côte d'Ivoire">
                        </figure>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Coaching Featured Image End -->
                    <!-- Coaching Entry Start -->
                    <div class="coaching-entry">
                        <h2 class="text-anime-style-3">Investment Opportunities</h2>
                        <p class="wow fadeInUp">Côte d'Ivoire has emerged as one of West Africa's most attractive investment destinations, combining a diversified economy, sustained growth, and a strategic position as the gateway to the region's 400-million-person market. From agriculture and agribusiness to energy, mining, infrastructure, and digital services, the country offers a broad pipeline of opportunities for investors seeking long-term returns.</p>
                        <p class="wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.2s">With a stable political environment, a modernizing legal framework, and active support from institutions such as CEPICI (Centre de Promotion des Investissements en Côte d'Ivoire), the country has become a preferred entry point for both regional and international capital. The government's National Development Plan prioritizes private-sector participation across key sectors.</p>

                        <!-- Coaching Entry Image Start -->
                        <div class="coaching-entry-image">
                            <!-- Coaching Entry Img Start -->
                            <div class="coaching-entry-img">
                                <figure class="image-anime reveal">
                                    <img src="~/img/Invest/000_8RD3RZ-964482942.jpg" alt="Côte d'Ivoire economic landscape">
                                </figure>
                            </div>
                            <!-- Coaching Entry Img End -->
                            <!-- Coaching Entry Img Start -->
                            <div class="coaching-entry-img">
                                <figure class="image-anime reveal">
                                    <img src="~/img/Invest/maxresdefault-3547175147.jpg" alt="Business in Côte d'Ivoire">
                                </figure>
                            </div>
                            <!-- Coaching Entry Img End -->
                        </div>
                        <!-- Coaching Entry Image End -->
                        <!-- Coaching Institutes Start -->
                        <div class="coaching-institutes">
                            <h2 class="text-anime-style-3">Key Sectors:</h2>

                            <!-- Coaching Entry List Image Start -->
                            <div class="coaching-entry-list-image">
 
                                <!-- Coaching Entry List Start -->
                                <div class="coaching-entry-list wow fadeInUp">
                                    <ul>
                                        <li>Agriculture and agribusiness: cocoa, cashew, rubber, and food processing.</li>
                                        <li>Energy and power: hydro, solar, and gas-to-power projects.</li>
                                        <li>Mining and natural resources: gold, manganese, nickel, and bauxite.</li>
                                        <li>Infrastructure and construction: transport, housing, and urban development.</li>
                                        <li>Digital economy and ICT: fintech, data centres, and telecoms.</li>
                                        <li>Tourism and hospitality: coastal resorts and cultural heritage.</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                                <!-- Coaching Entry List End -->
                            </div>
                            <!-- Coaching Entry List Image End -->
                        </div>
                        <!-- Coaching Institutes End -->
                        <!-- Coaching Preparation Start -->
                        <div class="coachine-preparation">
                            <h2 class="text-anime-style-3">Why Invest in Côte d'Ivoire</h2>
                            <p class="wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.2s">Côte d'Ivoire offers investors a compelling combination of scale, stability, and growth. As the world's largest cocoa producer and a leading exporter of cashew and rubber, the country has a strong agricultural base while its energy, mining, and infrastructure pipelines are opening new opportunities every year. Abidjan serves as the region's financial and commercial hub, hosting the headquarters of major banks, insurers, and multinationals. With a young, urbanizing population, sustained GDP growth above 6%, and a government actively courting foreign direct investment, the country presents a rare blend of emerging-market upside and improving business fundamentals.</p>
                        </div>
                        <!-- Coaching Preparation End -->
                    </div>
                    <!-- Coaching Entry End -->
